## The village hall

::bg{location="village_hall" time="afternoon"}
::use{component="enter" who="elder" instance="use-001"}
@elder{code="0010" emotion="stern"}: The intern. With paper. Let's see it.
@narrator{code="0010"}: Maren reads it twice, holding it at arm's length, then close, as if the weather might be in the small print.
@elder{code="0020" emotion="happy"}: Clear. Clear! Then we hang them. All of them.
::set{run.forecastDelivered = true}
